{{Book|content=
The loss of the Sunwell has affected us all, some more profoundly than others. Our daily use of the arcane has been curtailed. Unfortunately, some individuals have miscalculated the severity of the situation and have now fallen prey to their hunger, transforming into the withered.

As a promising mage apprentice, times may prove to be quite challenging for you. With the arcane being your primary source of power, you must possess the control and discipline to comprehend your limitations. Seek me out on the lower level of the main building, where our journey together can commence.
