'''Lushwater Oasis''', just south of the [[Crossroads]], is probably the most important of the oases in the [[Barrens]] in that it is the entrance to the accursed [[Wailing Caverns]]. [[Kolkar]] [[centaur]] stalk between the trees, eager to hunt the wild beasts coming to drink. Due to its closeness to the Wailing Caverns and Crossroads, this is a popular spot to fish for [[Deviate Fish]], the integral ingredient in the popular (if idiosyncratic) [[Savory Deviate Delight]].

